 queries on the same block. See the following https://forum.openzeppelin.com/t/iterating-over-elements-on-enumerableset-in-openzeppelin-contracts/2296[forum post] for more information."},"getRoleMemberCount(bytes32)":{"details":"Returns the number of accounts that have `role`. Can be used together with {getRoleMember} to enumerate all bearers of a role."},"getSchainToAllERC20(string,uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Should return an array of range of tokens were added by Schain owner  or added automatically after sending to schain if whitelist was turned off."},"getSchainToAllERC20Length(string)":{"details":"Should return length of a set of all mapped tokens which were added by Schain owner  or added automatically after sending to schain if whitelist was turned off."},"getSchainToERC20(string,address)":{"details":"Should return true if token was added by Schain owner or  added automatically after sending to schain if whitelist was turned off."},"grantRole(bytes32,address)":{"details":"Overload {grantRole} to track enumerable memberships"},"hasRole(bytes32,address)":{"details":"Returns `true` if `account` has been granted `role`."},"hasSchainContract(string)":{"details":"Returns true if mainnet contract and schain contract are connected together for transferring messages."},"initialize(address)":{"details":"initialize - sets current address of ContractManager of SkaleManager.","params":{"newContractManagerOfSkaleManager":"- current address of ContractManager of SkaleManager."}},"initialize(address,address,address)":{"details":"Creates a new DepositBoxERC20 contract."},"initializeAllTokensForSchain(string,address[])":{"details":"Allows DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE to initialize token mapping Notice - this function will be executed only once during upgrade  Requirements:  `msg.sender` should has DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE"},"isSchainOwner(address,bytes32)":{"details":"Checks whether sender is owner of SKALE chain"},"isWhitelisted(string)":{"details":"Returns is whitelist enabled on schain."